CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1786214542
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G1/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCFreely needs to be at least as
OL,4,Cgood as Freeview ` but it's not there
OL,5,Cyet
OL,6,
OL,7,FIf Freely is ever to replace Freeview,
OL,8,Fthe process will need to be driven by
OL,9,Fconsumers.
OL,11,FPeople will need to voluntarily upgrade
OL,12,Fto Freely. It cannot be forced on them.
OL,14,FI thought I'd do a little consumer
OL,15,Ftesting to see whether Freely is worth
OL,16,Fit.
OL,18,FI tried out both a Manhattan set top
OL,19,Fbox and a friend's television with
OL,20,Fbuilt in Freely capability.
OL,23,EPub: 08-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14102
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1786214542
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G2/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCFreely needs to be at least as
OL,4,Cgood as Freeview ` but it's not there
OL,5,Cyet
OL,6,
OL,7,FBoth pieces of hardware were expensive
OL,8,Ftop-of-the-range equipment. They were
OL,9,Fno problems connecting them up through
OL,10,Fbroadband. They worked perfectly.
OL,12,FYet I faced a number of practical
OL,13,Fdifficulties.
OL,15,FFirstly simply changing channels takes
OL,16,Faround 5 seconds. Switching from BBC
OL,17,FOne to ITV 1 hasn't been this hard
OL,18,Fsince the days when a viewer would
OL,19,Fclick round the VHF tuner. And you can
OL,20,Fforget about just flicking through the
OL,21,Fchannels.
OL,23,EPub: 08-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14103
SC,0003
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1786214542
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G3/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCFreely needs to be at least as
OL,4,Cgood as Freeview ` but it's not there
OL,5,Cyet
OL,6,
OL,7,FSecondly, there is an obvious time
OL,8,Fdelay ` a particular pain if you like
OL,9,Fwatching live sport. I reckon the
OL,10,Fpicture must be about 25 ` 30 seconds
OL,11,Fbehind Freeview.
OL,13,FAnd I have a few reservations about the
OL,14,Fpicture quality.
OL,16,FThe good news is that several channels
OL,17,Fwhich are only available in SD on
OL,18,FFreeview ` including ITV's spin-off
OL,19,Fchannels and BBC News ` are in HD on
OL,20,FFreely.
OL,23,EPub: 08-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14104
SC,0004
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1786214542
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G4/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCFreely needs to be at least as
OL,4,Cgood as Freeview ` but it's not there
OL,5,Cyet
OL,6,
OL,7,FThe bad news is that some channels `
OL,8,Fnotably the ITV channels ` aren't
OL,9,Finterlaced. Live programmes look
OL,10,Ffilmic.
OL,12,FIncidentally, the main BBC channels
OL,13,Falso have a corporate DOG.
OL,15,FThese things can be sorted and I don't
OL,16,Fmean to be negative. There are
OL,17,Fpositives too like the interface
OL,18,Fbetween live TV and catch-up.
OL,23,EPub: 08-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
OL,24,ANext PageBClean FeedCNat TVFOn This Day
FL,142,140,200,120,0,100
PN,14105
SC,0005
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F141A1786214542
OL,1,W~+$ hw1~{4~k4 ~shw1~sj7}         G5/5
OL,2,W+.!+,"-$/*%/*% / "-$+,*-'U(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GOPINIONCFreely needs to be at least as
OL,4,Cgood as Freeview ` but it's not there
OL,5,Cyet
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut before you can even contemplate
OL,8,Freplacing Freeview with Freely, the
OL,9,Fbasic functionality and picture quality
OL,10,Fmust be at least as good.
OL,23,EPub: 08-Aug-2026Upppppppppppppppppppppp
